   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Vantrell Labs is compliant with all three covenants on its Venture Term Loan for the period ended October 31, 2026. Each figure on the compliance certificate matches the bank's calculation. The most notable change is a steady narrowing of the cushion over the minimum unrestricted cash covenant, flagged by one low-severity signal, although cash of {{fact:a506654a-cb2b-4bf7-875e-6944c8e8758d}} remains above the {{fact:46daa775-581b-4f9c-9ffa-ddd88a90cf30}} floor. There are no open work items awaiting a decision.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Runway is compliant: calculated at {{fact:2b1e7558-4556-48b0-82db-e93517568050}} against a requirement of {{fact:0ac0b2eb-7213-4ae2-9454-418d21d092ea}}, a cushion of {{fact:ef861462-e844-42d4-b7cb-bbdb8734dcff}}. Minimum Unrestricted Cash is compliant at {{fact:a506654a-cb2b-4bf7-875e-6944c8e8758d}} against {{fact:46daa775-581b-4f9c-9ffa-ddd88a90cf30}}, a cushion of {{fact:411e31f9-e3e0-4e1b-870f-67ed760b788c}}. Revenue to Plan is compliant at {{fact:75845218-ffbe-4275-b7b4-fa7bf22885fd}} against {{fact:d59b35ff-77c3-42d4-ad79-8553fa9e2ebf}}, a cushion of {{fact:182254c6-ab9a-43e9-927d-01c71a7e3322}}. The certificate reports {{fact:f59b1aa0-df29-4e4b-b840-dc95876ec5d8}}, {{fact:2124421d-3d09-43f9-b3e6-e07298fde2c5}} and {{fact:53c86cac-26ea-4a57-88f6-7b261ffde44f}} respectively, matching the bank's calculations.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"One low-severity signal fired. The cushion over the minimum cash covenant has narrowed in each month from August through September to {{fact:411e31f9-e3e0-4e1b-870f-67ed760b788c}} in October, which points to an ongoing cash burn trend rather than a near-term compliance issue. The August and September cushion values are not among the facts provided for this review, so a reviewer may wish to confirm them in the underlying calculation runs. No other signal fired to corroborate or explain the trend, and there are no open work items.\"}]}",
